---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Zero to one marketing — AgenticPath"
  description="Marketing with agentic systems for B2B companies with complex, high-value sales."
>
  <header class="hero">
    <h1 class="tagline"><span class="digit" id="digit-a">0</span> <span class="digit" id="digit-b">0</span> <span class="word">marketing.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Skip <span class="hl">expensive</span> setup. <span class="hl">Agentic</span> Marketing. Move the <span class="hl">needle</span>. In 2 <span class="hl">months</span>.</p>
    <p class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn" href="#contact">Get in touch</a> <a class="btn btn-light" href="#how">See how we work</a></p>
  </header>

  <div class="panels" id="product">
    <div class="panel-col">
      <div class="panel" aria-label="Sample audit findings panel">
        <span class="panel-tag">SAMPLE</span>
        <div class="p-head"><span><span class="dot"></span>AUDIT / WEEK 2</span><span>14 FINDINGS</span></div>
        <div class="finding">
          <span class="sev sev-high">HIGH</span><span class="f-title">No visibility in AI answers</span>
          <div class="f-note">AI answers for your category name three competitors. You are absent.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="finding">
          <span class="sev sev-high">HIGH</span><span class="f-title">Paid spend, no retargeting</span>
          <div class="f-note">Traffic spend with no audience coming back.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="finding">
          <span class="sev sev-med">MED</span><span class="f-title">CRM handoff leaks</span>
          <div class="f-note">MQL to SQL has no owner and no follow-up window.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="finding">
          <span class="sev sev-ok">OK</span><span class="f-title">Offer pages</span>
          <div class="f-note">Clear, fast, credible. Keep.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:10px; color:#9aa38d; font-size:12px;">Plus 10 more findings in the full audit.</div>
      </div>
      <h3>Audit</h3>
      <p>Month one. We read the funnel, the site, the ads and the CRM, and rank what is broken by impact.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#how">How we work</a>
    </div>

    <div class="panel-col">
      <div class="panel" aria-label="Sample strategy plan panel">
        <span class="panel-tag">SAMPLE</span>
        <div class="p-head"><span><span class="dot"></span>GTM PLAN / MONTH 2</span><span>V1.0</span></div>
        <div class="plan-row"><span class="ch">AEO + SEO</span><span class="hz hz-slow">SLOW / ORGANIC</span></div>
        <div class="plan-row"><span class="ch">Performance</span><span class="hz hz-fast">FAST / PAID</span></div>
        <div class="plan-row"><span class="ch">Retargeting</span><span class="hz hz-fast">FAST / PAID</span></div>
        <div class="plan-row"><span class="ch">ABM + outreach</span><span class="hz">NAMED ACCOUNTS</span></div>
        <div class="plan-row"><span class="ch">Content + design</span><span class="hz">SUPPORTS ALL</span></div>
        <div class="plan-row"><span class="ch">Social</span><span class="hz">PROOF + REACH</span></div>
        <div style="margin-top:14px; color:#9aa38d; font-size:12px;">
          The plan picks from the menu. It is not the menu.
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3>Strategy</h3>
      <p>Month two. A go-to-market plan with channel priorities, budgets and a 90-day roadmap.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#engagement">The engagement</a>
    </div>

    <div class="panel-col">
      <div class="panel term" aria-label="Agent workflow terminal panel">
        <span class="panel-tag">SAMPLE</span>
        <div class="p-head"><span><span class="dot"></span>WORKFLOW</span><span>EXAMPLE RUN</span></div>
        <div id="term-body"></div>
        <span class="cursor" id="term-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <h3>Execution</h3>
      <p>Agents run the repeatable work, research, drafts, checks and reporting. Seniors approve what ships.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#contact">Talk to us</a>
    </div>

    <div class="panel-col">
      <div class="panel" aria-label="Sample mission control dashboard panel">
        <span class="panel-tag">DEMO DATA</span>
        <div class="p-head"><span><span class="dot"></span>MISSION CONTROL</span><span>CLIENT VIEW</span></div>
        <div class="stat-grid">
          <div class="stat-cell"><div class="v">$1.61M</div><div class="k">PIPELINE IN PLAY</div></div>
          <div class="stat-cell"><div class="v">07</div><div class="k">OPEN DEALS</div></div>
          <div class="stat-cell"><div class="v">60%</div><div class="k">WIN RATE</div></div>
          <div class="stat-cell"><div class="v">74%</div><div class="k">BUDGET PACING</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bar-row"><span class="bl">First calls</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:82%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><span class="bl">In proposal</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill lime" style="width:56%"></div></div></div>
        <div class="bar-row"><span class="bl">Closed won</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:38%"></div></div></div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px; color:#9aa38d; font-size:12px;">
          Next action suggested by an agent, approved by a human.
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3>Mission control</h3>
      <p>Every client gets their own dashboard. Pipeline, budgets and agent suggestions in one place.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#banner">Mission control</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="block" id="who" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="block-label">Who is it for</div>
    <div>
      <div class="cell-grid">
        <div class="cell"><span class="c-name">B2B</span><span class="c-note">Companies selling to companies.</span></div>
        <div class="cell"><span class="c-name">Long cycles</span><span class="c-note">Sales cycles measured in months.</span></div>
        <div class="cell"><span class="c-name">High-value ticket</span><span class="c-note">Deals where the stakes are high.</span></div>
        <div class="cell"><span class="c-name">Flat growth</span><span class="c-note">Growth that has stalled.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="problem" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="block-label">The problem</div>
    <div>
      <p class="block-intro"><strong>Long cycles. High stakes. Marketing that does not keep up.</strong></p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n">01</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Foundations</h4>
            <p>Positioning, website and target customers that were never properly established.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n">02</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Measurement</h4>
            <p>No clear picture of what marketing does, or what it should be measured on.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n">03</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Demand</h4>
            <p>Demand generation that does not match a sales cycle measured in months.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n">04</span>
          <div>
            <h4>The handoff</h4>
            <p>Marketing and sales not connected, so opportunities stall between them.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="who-we-are" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="block-label">Who we are</div>
    <div>
      <p class="who-line">20+ years experience <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> B2B performance marketing <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> Product management <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> Product development <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> Impact-driven <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> data-measured <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">|</span> scale-ups</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="engagement" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="block-label">The engagement</div>
    <div>
      <p class="block-intro"><strong>Two months. Then you decide.</strong></p>
      <svg class="journey" viewBox="0 0 760 240" role="img" aria-label="A route with three stops: month one audit, month two strategy, then optional execution, ending in a lime square full stop. A lime point travels along the route through the three stops.">
        <line class="route" x1="40" y1="70" x2="680" y2="70" />
        <g class="node-1">
          <circle class="node" cx="140" cy="70" r="20" />
          <text class="node-num" x="140" y="75" text-anchor="middle">01</text>
          <text class="stop-label" x="140" y="130" text-anchor="middle">Audit</text>
          <text class="stop-detail" x="140" y="156" text-anchor="middle">Month one</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node-2">
          <circle class="node" cx="380" cy="70" r="20" />
          <text class="node-num" x="380" y="75" text-anchor="middle">02</text>
          <text class="stop-label" x="380" y="130" text-anchor="middle">Strategy</text>
          <text class="stop-detail" x="380" y="156" text-anchor="middle">Month two</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node-3">
          <circle class="node" cx="620" cy="70" r="20" />
          <text class="node-num" x="620" y="75" text-anchor="middle">03</text>
          <text class="stop-label" x="620" y="130" text-anchor="middle">Execution</text>
          <text class="stop-detail" x="620" y="156" text-anchor="middle">Optional</text>
        </g>
        <circle id="journey-dot" class="traveller" r="7" cx="0" cy="0">
          <animateMotion dur="12s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M40,70 L680,70" />
        </circle>
        <rect class="full-stop" x="688" y="55" width="30" height="30" />
      </svg>
      <p class="block-note">One month to understand how you win customers today. One month to turn that into a tailored strategy and go-to-market plan. Execution after that is your call, not ours to assume.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="how" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="block-label">How we work</div>
    <div>
      <p class="block-intro"><strong>Human-led. Agentic where it repeats.</strong></p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n">01</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Month one, audit</h4>
            <p>We build a grounded picture of how you win and serve customers today: positioning, channels, the sales path, the data you have, and where opportunities stall.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n">02</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Month two, strategy</h4>
            <p>The audit findings become a tailored strategy and go-to-market plan, sequenced, with the measurement to match.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="n">03</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Then, execution</h4>
            <p>Optional. Paid media, organic search and content, social activity, analytics, and RevOps, with agentic systems supporting the repeatable work over time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="banner" id="banner">
    <div class="b-kicker">MISSION CONTROL</div>
    <h2>Everything you need to see your marketing working</h2>
    <p>
      Pipeline, budgets, pacing and the next action an agent suggests, in one
      dashboard per client. You see your company. We see the work across all
      of them, and we do the work in the same place you watch it.
    </p>
    <a class="btn" href="#contact">Start with the audit</a>
    <div class="banner-dots" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>

  <section class="block" id="contact" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="block-label">Talk to us</div>
    <div>
      <p class="block-intro"><strong>Tell us what marketing should do.</strong></p>
      <p class="lede">A short note is enough. We read every message and reply ourselves.</p>
      <iframe
        class="contact-form"
        src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd6_JaUBZmlDsEuRnHvLHHnYs9AA9WSED-D__tYVtDPusqkgg/viewform?embedded=true"
        title="AgenticPath get in touch form"
        loading="lazy"
      >Loading the form…</iframe>
      <p class="muted">Prefer the form on its own page? <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd6_JaUBZmlDsEuRnHvLHHnYs9AA9WSED-D__tYVtDPusqkgg/viewform">Open it here</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="closing" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="block-label">Where we are</div>
    <div>
      <p class="block-intro"><strong>We are winning our first customers before scaling the product.</strong></p>
      <p class="block-note">This site is a scaffold, not a catalogue of services. The work starts with a conversation, not a package.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
